{"articleNo":"360564","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=360564&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[학부(과)] K-디지털 기초역량훈련(K-디지털 아카데미):참여안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.04.12","hit":"33772","attachments":[{"name":"훈련안내 (1).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=360564&attachNo=111142"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY견고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 145, 0);\">K-</span><span style=\"font-family: HY견고딕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 145, 0);\">디지털 기초역량훈련</span></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">개요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">기초코딩</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">웹</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">앱개발 등 디지털 기초 과정을 언제</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">어디서든&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">100% </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B;\">원격으로 수강할 수 있도록 정부가 지원하는 훈련과정</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">내용</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">디지털 기초 강의 수강에 사용할 수 있는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">50</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">년 한도</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">의 수강&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">비용을 국민내일배움카드를 통해 지급</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">기존 국민내일배움카드 수강비 지원 한도인 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">년간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">300~500</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">만원과는&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">별도로 지원</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">과정 신청 시 수강 비용의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">10%</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">를 자비로 부담</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">자비부담금은 과정 수료시 전액 환급</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">- 4</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">년제 대학 재학생은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">학년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 양재참숯체B; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 종료시점부터 참여가능&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B;\">졸업까지 수업연한이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B;\">년이내인 경우 국민내일배움카드발급가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-4월12일이후 담당자 문의후 <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">국민내일배움카드 발급</span>으로 참여가능</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 양재참숯체B; let